  "abstract": "Baseline Fourier forecaster with LayerNorm in factor space and residual copy, enhanced by a per-factor constant trend and \u03b3[t] initialized to a 0.25\u21920.99 ramp. Uses proj_rank p=36 (observed sweet spot), M=16 harmonics, Adam lr=9e-4 with global grad clipping (1.0). Loss: MAE + temporal curvature (\u03bb=1e-4).",
